        "name": "Waning Flowers of a World Eternal - The Rainbow Appears After Flowering Rain",
        "steam_appid": 3410630,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel about one man's quest to defy the laws of &quot;this world&quot; to protect those important to him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-choice VN, each of the four heroines possessing their own unique epilogue</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full professional Japanese voice acting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality sprite and CG viewer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneous multi-language display support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arriving in a scenic town filled with flowers, Sho and Ren encounters Haru and the others working at a café. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking up residence on the second floor, Sho begins working alongside them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, he spots Haru sneaking out alone in the dead of night and decides to follow her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far from town, beneath a pale moonlit tree on a hill surrounded by flowers as far as the eye can see, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sho witnesses the moment a small girl in Haru’s arms turns into a flower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noticing Sho, Haru smiles sadly at the magnificently blooming flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“This is how I’ve managed to survive in this world. But I want to keep on living. Even if that means exchanging another’s life.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking up at the falling petals with Haru, Sho declares:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“No matter what this world forces upon you… No matter how much others will condemn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you…”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I'll wish for this world to end.”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/e8212c1951e62168f2fd339aa09ae503.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haru (Voice: Sawasawa Sawa)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second of three sisters who work at Famille, the café on the outskirts of town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also acts as the café’s manager, in charge of cakes and sweets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and easy-going girl whose smile never fades, even in times of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in truth, she’s the most strong-willed and stubborn of her sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to her inability to go to bed at a reasonable hour, hardly a single day goes by without her being late. Mostly because of how much time she spends writing in her diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/2af6beb14558b48219a690799893bb66.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kotose (Voice: Iroha Natsumine)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eldest of the three sisters who work at Famille.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly in charge of the dining floor, as well as tea and drinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhat of a meddling caretaker, as big sisters tend to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elegant and graceful beauty who always takes jokes at face value, making her fun to tease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being an avid reader, she is a regular at the local bookstore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also grows her own tea leaves at home the old-fashioned way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/8f8471f6b5c1d5ba128fc37bad9cbc67.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukina (Voice: Wakaba Tani)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The youngest of the three sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her job is mainly serving customers and making little crafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful, fearless girl who doesn’t shy away from speaking her mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although a fun-loving free spirit, she is also the one able to observe things most clearly among her sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled with handiwork, her specialty is crafting bookmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a habit of grinning widely, showing her teeth when she smiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/7243252b37762ac0247365eae9c6d179.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren (Voice: Hana Akino)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The young girl who arrives in town with Sho.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she takes up residence at Famille, she mainly works as more of the café’s mascot, rather than a waitress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The word “innocent” describes her perfectly, and her emotions are always plain to see on her face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her adorableness soothes all who watch her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a habit of apologizing, made all the more guilt-inducing due to her appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is very fond of Sho, much like a little sister.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel about one man's quest to defy the laws of &quot;this world&quot; to protect those important to him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-choice VN, each of the four heroines possessing their own unique epilogue</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full professional Japanese voice acting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality sprite and CG viewer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneous multi-language display support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arriving in a scenic town filled with flowers, Sho and Ren encounters Haru and the others working at a café. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking up residence on the second floor, Sho begins working alongside them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, he spots Haru sneaking out alone in the dead of night and decides to follow her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far from town, beneath a pale moonlit tree on a hill surrounded by flowers as far as the eye can see, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sho witnesses the moment a small girl in Haru’s arms turns into a flower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noticing Sho, Haru smiles sadly at the magnificently blooming flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“This is how I’ve managed to survive in this world. But I want to keep on living. Even if that means exchanging another’s life.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking up at the falling petals with Haru, Sho declares:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“No matter what this world forces upon you… No matter how much others will condemn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you…”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I'll wish for this world to end.”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/e8212c1951e62168f2fd339aa09ae503.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haru (Voice: Sawasawa Sawa)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second of three sisters who work at Famille, the café on the outskirts of town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also acts as the café’s manager, in charge of cakes and sweets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and easy-going girl whose smile never fades, even in times of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in truth, she’s the most strong-willed and stubborn of her sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to her inability to go to bed at a reasonable hour, hardly a single day goes by without her being late. Mostly because of how much time she spends writing in her diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/2af6beb14558b48219a690799893bb66.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kotose (Voice: Iroha Natsumine)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eldest of the three sisters who work at Famille.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly in charge of the dining floor, as well as tea and drinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhat of a meddling caretaker, as big sisters tend to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elegant and graceful beauty who always takes jokes at face value, making her fun to tease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being an avid reader, she is a regular at the local bookstore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also grows her own tea leaves at home the old-fashioned way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/8f8471f6b5c1d5ba128fc37bad9cbc67.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukina (Voice: Wakaba Tani)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The youngest of the three sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her job is mainly serving customers and making little crafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful, fearless girl who doesn’t shy away from speaking her mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although a fun-loving free spirit, she is also the one able to observe things most clearly among her sisters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled with handiwork, her specialty is crafting bookmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a habit of grinning widely, showing her teeth when she smiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410630/extras/7243252b37762ac0247365eae9c6d179.avif?t=1782997218\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren (Voice: Hana Akino)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The young girl who arrives in town with Sho.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she takes up residence at Famille, she mainly works as more of the café’s mascot, rather than a waitress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The word “innocent” describes her perfectly, and her emotions are always plain to see on her face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her adorableness soothes all who watch her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a habit of apologizing, made all the more guilt-inducing due to her appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is very fond of Sho, much like a little sister.</p>",
        "short_description": "Is one life worth the price of another? A bittersweet visual novel about life and death, trust and bonds, and promises made. Brought to you by popular Japanese bishojo game developer SWEET&amp;TEA. Winner of the Moe Game Awards 2016's &quot;New Brand Award&quot;!",
